<!doctype html>
<html>
<body>
  <p>Hi <%= name %>,</p>
  <p>Confirm your email to complete your Pathfinder College application. Enter this code on the verification page:</p>
  <h1 style="letter-spacing: 6px; font-size: 25px; color: #2563eb"><%= code %></h1>
  <p>The code expires in <%= expiresIn %>. Open the verification page:</p>
  <p><a href="<%= verifyUrl %>"><%= verifyUrl %></a></p>
  <p>Your application is not submitted and no account is created until this code is entered.
     If you did not apply to Pathfinder College, ignore this email and do not share the code.</p>
  <p>Best regards,<br>Pathfinder College Team</p>
</body>
</html>
